<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's corporate bond issue applications rise.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's corporate bond issue applications rise.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's applications for corporate bond  issues for August were estimated at 2.86 trillion won, up from actual  issues of 1.79 trillion won a year earlier, Korea Securities Dealers'  Association said on Friday.</p>
<p>In July, applications totalled 2.8 trillion won and 99.9 percent of  which were approved.</p>
</text>
